<title>UK: Norway's Statfjord to load 27 cargoes in Feb.</title>
<headline>Norway's Statfjord to load 27 cargoes in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Statfjord crude system is scheduled to load 27 cargoes in February, two down from January, traders said.</p>
<p>The slightly lower loading programme accounts for the shorter month, they said.</p>
<p>Statfjord crude is loaded offshore in 855,000- barrel shipments.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 5387</p>
</text>
